<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: boring singing shanties -->
  <VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.boring_singing_shanties.label>cantoria de marujo chata</VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.boring_singing_shanties.label>
  <!-- EN: The cap'n displayed a lack of passion and the feeling of camaraderie just wasn't there. -->
  <VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.boring_singing_shanties.description>O capitão cantou sem paixão nenhuma, e o clima de camaradagem simplesmente não veio.</VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.boring_singing_shanties.description>
  <!-- EN: lame singing shanties -->
  <VFEP_LameShanties.stages.lame_singing_shanties.label>cantoria de marujo fraca</VFEP_LameShanties.stages.lame_singing_shanties.label>
  <!-- EN: The cap'n treated us like children, wanting so desperately to hear something to lift their spirits. -->
  <VFEP_LameShanties.stages.lame_singing_shanties.description>O capitão nos tratou como crianças, querendo desesperadamente ouvir algo que levantasse o ânimo.</VFEP_LameShanties.stages.lame_singing_shanties.description>
  <!-- EN: rousing singing shanties -->
  <VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.rousing_singing_shanties.label>cantoria de marujo animada</VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.rousing_singing_shanties.label>
  <!-- EN: Shiver me timbers, those were some good shanties! The cap'n lifted our spirits and made us feel a camaraderie and togetherness that will only make us stronger. -->
  <VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.rousing_singing_shanties.description>Raios me partam, que cantoria boa! O capitão levantou nosso ânimo e nos fez sentir uma camaradagem e uma união que só vão nos deixar mais fortes.</VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.rousing_singing_shanties.description>
  <!-- EN: amazing singing shanties -->
  <VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.amazing_singing_shanties.label>cantoria de marujo incrível</VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.amazing_singing_shanties.label>
  <!-- EN: We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the cap'n, as they reminded us of the importance of our shared camaraderie. We can even feel our sadness vanish away. -->
  <VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.amazing_singing_shanties.description>Ainda ouvimos as palavras hipnotizantes do capitão, que nos lembraram da importância da nossa camaradagem. Dá até para sentir a tristeza sumindo.</VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.amazing_singing_shanties.description>
</LanguageData>
